@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;architecture] ios-share-record-is-sanitized-and-source-bound
The App Group MUST contain only an opaque source token, a public HTTPS origin and
one bounded versioned canonical link payload with a nonce and expiry. Account names,
sessions, Access credentials, settings, model keys and raw shared text MUST NOT enter
it. The host-private source namespace MUST remain outside the group. Source: the
accepted 21 Oct 2026 native share handoff and app-private credential plan.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;architecture] ios-share-record-coordinates-real-processes
Activation, replacement, revocation, save and consumption MUST coordinate through
one cross-process OS lock and protected atomic files. A writer that captured an
older token MUST fail after revocation or replacement. Consumption MUST remove the
record under that lock before delivery, so two processes cannot import it twice.
Expired, malformed and foreign-token records MUST NOT open a route. Source: the
accepted 21 Oct 2026 native handoff concurrency and file-protection plan.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;security] ios-share-token-persists-only-for-the-same-eligible-source
A pending handoff and its opaque token MUST survive app-process recreation and
same-account verification or renewal. A genuine source replacement MUST permanently
retire the prior token before new-source import. Unavailable or protected storage
MUST fail closed for import; it MUST NOT block ordinary account cleanup. Source:
the accepted 21 Oct 2026 persistent source-owned share handoff plan.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;product] ios-share-corrupt-authority-recovers-with-bounded-revocation
Malformed or oversized private identity or shared source data MUST retire both
durable sides before a bounded attempt to activate a fresh token. Failed retirement
MUST keep imports disabled. Unavailable or protected reads MUST NOT be classified as
malformed data, rotate a valid token or discard a pending record. A malformed pending
record MAY be removed without rotating its valid source. Source: the accepted
21 Oct 2026 native share handoff recovery and same-source persistence plan.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;product] ios-share-lock-contention-does-not-block-the-host
Host and extension handoff operations MUST NOT wait for another process's file lock.
Contention MUST fail promptly with a distinct retryable busy result, preserving an
unconsumed same-source token and record. A contended revocation MUST return promptly
and keep imports disabled until both durable sides retire. Source: the accepted
21 Oct 2026 native share handoff plan and its MainActor lock-contention review finding.
